      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The desire to reclaim your agency and stop feeling like a mere component is a deeply human need, but please know that your worth isn't tied to your productivity or your function in any system. True agency can sometimes be found in small, deliberate acts of choosing what you allow into your life, even when everything else feels overwhelming. If you are in crisis, please consider reaching out to emergency services or a crisis line, as they offer immediate, non-judgmental support.",
